  "": "agentx (hook-comms) v0.7.31 - multi-agent communication\nUsage:\n  agentx                                  TUI dashboard\n  agentx <command>                        Run command\n  agentx [command...] --help              Show help for this command\n  agentx [command...] --help-all          Expand all help below this command\nLaunch:\n  agentx launch [--profile NAME | --tool TOOL] [--count N] [flags] [-- tool-args]\n  Tools: claude|gemini|codex|opencode|kilo|pi|omp|hermes|antigravity|cursor|kimi|copilot|qoder|grok\n  agentx resume <target>                  Resume stopped agent\n  agentx fork <target>                    Fork agent session (claude/codex/opencode/kilo/pi/omp/qoder/grok)\n  agentx kill <name(s)|all>         Kill + close terminal pane\n  Shortcuts: l = launch, r = resume, f = fork, k = kill\nCommands:\n  send         Send message to your buddies\n  listen       Block until message or event arrives\n  list         Show agents, status, unread counts\n  events       Query event stream, manage subscriptions\n  bundle       Structured context packages for handoffs\n  transcript   Read another agent's conversation\n  start        Connect to agentx (run inside any AI tool)\n  stop         Disconnect from agentx\n  profile      Manage reusable launch configurations\n  config       Get/set global and per-agent settings\n  attach       Attach to a running agent's tmux terminal\n  run          Execute workflow scripts\n  relay        Cross-device sync + relay daemon\n  archive      Query past agentx sessions\n  reset        Archive and clear database\n  hooks        Add or remove hooks\n  status       Installation and diagnostics\n  observe      Inspect existing daemon/config/event evidence\n  observe-web  Serve read-only browser diagnostics\n  workbench    Open project collaboration in a browser\n  daemon       Inspect or explicitly restart the native scope daemon\n  work         Read work and report assigned results/checks\n  term         View/inject into agent PTY screens\n  update       Check and apply updates\nEnvironment files (before --):\n  --env-file PATH                         Ordered dotenv file (repeatable)\n  --env-override / --no-env-override       Replace / preserve inherited values\n  AGENTX_ENV_FILES                        Comma-separated file list\n  agentx config environment --json        Inspect sources/provenance without values",
