  "profile": "Manage reusable tool launch configurations\nUsage: agentx profile <COMMAND>\nCommands:\n  list     List saved profiles and default selections\n  show     Show one saved definition (not a launch's effective configuration)\n  create   Create a profile; native args must follow --\n  update   Update metadata, or replace the entire saved argv with --replace-args\n  delete   Delete a profile that is not selected as a default\n  default  Get, set or clear the scope default (or --tool TOOL default)\n  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\nOptions:\n  -h, --help  Print help",
