  "observe": "Read existing AgentX diagnostic evidence\nUsage: agentx observe [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]\nCommands:\n  inspect         Read the existing daemon's runtime/process snapshot\n  request         Read one exact native RequestObservationRef from a local JSON file\n  config          Read one exact retained ConfigSnapshotRef from a local JSON file\n  config-current  Explicitly reevaluate this invocation's scoped settings locally\n  compare         Compare two retained configuration refs; never reread current settings\n  events          Read a bounded native event window; follow stops on gaps/era changes\n  help            Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\nOptions:\n      --scope <PATH>  Existing data scope; default: originating AGENTX_DIR / home resolver\n      --json  Emit one JSON value; events --follow emits newline-delimited values\n  -h, --help  Print help\nNo subcommand means inspect. Files contain exact native JSON refs/windows (at most 32 KiB).\nUsage and recovery: .docs/observability/cli.md",
